WEBVTT

00:03:31.042 --> 00:03:32.518
takriban muda ule ule

00:03:32.542 --> 00:03:35.226
Nilipogundua namna ya kushirikiana
na Patrick,

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.458
Nilikwenda shule ya sheria Harvard.

00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:42.934
Nilikutana tena na swali hili,
nijiweke wapi,

00:03:42.958 --> 00:03:44.667
niuweke wapi mwili wangu?

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:48.101
Na nikawaza mwenyewe

00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:51.643
Kuwa Mississipi Delta
ni mahali ambapo watu wenye fedha,

00:03:51.667 --> 00:03:53.559
watu wenye fursa,

00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:54.833
watu hao huondoka.

00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:57.309
Na watu wanaobakia

00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:59.833
ni watu ambao hawana fursa ya kuondoka.